Note on WiFi data: this plugin reads access-point identifiers (BSSIDs) that
can be used to infer a device's location. Nothing in the Software transmits
anything anywhere — but if YOUR application transmits or stores scans, the
consent, disclosure, and app-store data-safety obligations are yours. See
docs/STORE-REVIEW.md.
